# Secrets must never enter the build context at all. The runtime stage does
# not copy them today, but a build ARG, a debug `--target builder`, or one
# careless COPY would ship them — and they persist in intermediate layers and
# the local build cache regardless.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/cdk.out
**/coverage
**/logs
apps/web
docs
.git
